-- Owner decision 2026-11-07, after the entry turn ("Kör B"): Konrad writes
-- the construction and code writes what follows from it
-- (lean_construction_version 1 on tools.save_construction_draft, the pin
-- new claimed jobs adopt with this manifest):
--   formulas: a number in the recipe, or in an upserted definition or part,
--     may be a formula over parameter node names; code adds the derived
--     nodes and bindings (entry wall: 81 bindings and 27 derived nodes, half
--     of the 26,590 characters Konrad typed for 11 parts);
--   joint_rules: one rule per pair of definitions; code writes a joint for
--     every touching pair it covers (21 hand-written joints, a quarter);
--   FORM: code maps added parts to the concept component holding them, and
--     part edits carry form_assign (two edits refused with
--     form_instance_unmapped, 13:48 and 13:59);
--   kept payloads: a refused construction write stays in the sketch, so the
--     next call sends only the correction (four refusals threw away a whole
--     written wall), and a saved construction can be revised whole in a
--     keyed sketch (commit_construction_sketch says how such a sketch is
--     committed).
-- Needs 20261107150000_construction_edit_form_mapping.sql and both Bob
-- runtimes with this code. Each tool is replaced only from the exact version
-- this file was generated from. Pinned manifests keep their behaviour.
